[{"kind":"html","html":"<p>Accordion group is a container for accordion instances. It manages the state of the accordions and provides keyboard navigation.</p><p>Refer to the <a class=\"\" href=\"/components/accordion\">Accordion</a> documentation for more information.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"interfaces","text":"Interfaces"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"accordiongroupchangeeventdetail","text":"AccordionGroupChangeEventDetail"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"language-typescript codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block\"><div class=\"codeBlockContent_QJqH\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-typescript codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><span class=\"token keyword\">interface</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token class-name\">AccordionGroupChangeEventDetail</span><span class=\"token class-name operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name constant\">T</span><span class=\"token class-name\"> </span><span class=\"token class-name operator\">=</span><span class=\"token class-name\"> </span><span class=\"token class-name builtin\">any</span><span class=\"token class-name operator\">&gt;</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span>\n<span class=\"token plain\">  value</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token constant\">T</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span>\n<span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"accordiongroupcustomevent","text":"AccordionGroupCustomEvent"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>While not required, this interface can be used in place of the <code>CustomEvent</code> interface for stronger typing with Ionic events emitted from this component.</p><div class=\"language-typescript codeBlockContainer_Ckt0 theme-code-block\"><div class=\"codeBlockContent_QJqH\"><pre tabindex=\"0\" class=\"prism-code language-typescript codeBlock_bY9V thin-scrollbar\"><code class=\"codeBlockLines_e6Vv\"><span class=\"token keyword\">interface</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token class-name\">AccordionGroupCustomEvent</span><span class=\"token class-name operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token class-name constant\">T</span><span class=\"token class-name\"> </span><span class=\"token class-name operator\">=</span><span class=\"token class-name\"> </span><span class=\"token class-name builtin\">any</span><span class=\"token class-name operator\">&gt;</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token keyword\">extends</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token class-name\">CustomEvent</span><span class=\"token plain\"> </span><span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span>\n<span class=\"token plain\">  detail</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> AccordionGroupChangeEventDetail</span><span class=\"token operator\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token constant\">T</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span>\n<span class=\"token plain\">  target</span><span class=\"token operator\">:</span><span class=\"token plain\"> HTMLIonAccordionGroupElement</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">;</span><span class=\"token plain\"></span>\n<span class=\"token plain\"></span><span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span></code></pre></div></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"properties","text":"Properties"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-animated","text":"animated"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>If <code>true</code>, all accordions inside of the accordion group will animate when expanding or collapsing.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>animated</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>boolean</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>true</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-disabled","text":"disabled"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>If <code>true</code>, the accordion group cannot be interacted with.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>disabled</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>boolean</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>false</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-expand","text":"expand"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>Describes the expansion behavior for each accordion. Possible values are <code>\"compact\"</code> and <code>\"inset\"</code>. Defaults to <code>\"compact\"</code>.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>expand</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>\"compact\" ｜ \"inset\"</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>'compact'</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-mode","text":"mode"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>The mode determines which platform styles to use.<br><br>This is a <a class=\"\" href=\"https://ionicframework.com/docs/core-concepts/fundamentals#virtual-properties\">virtual property</a> that is set once during initialization and will not update if you change its value after the initial render.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>mode</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>\"ios\" ｜ \"md\"</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>undefined</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-multiple","text":"multiple"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>If <code>true</code>, the accordion group can have multiple accordion components expanded at the same time.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>multiple</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>boolean ｜ undefined</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>undefined</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-readonly","text":"readonly"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>If <code>true</code>, the accordion group cannot be interacted with, but does not alter the opacity.</td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>readonly</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>boolean</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>false</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":3,"id":"prop-value","text":"value"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><tbody><tr><td><strong>Description</strong></td><td>The value of the accordion group. This controls which accordions are expanded. This should be an array of strings only when <code>multiple=\"true\"</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Attribute</strong></td><td><code>value</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Type</strong></td><td><code>null ｜ string ｜ string[] ｜ undefined</code></td></tr><tr><td><strong>Default</strong></td><td><code>undefined</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"events","text":"Events"},{"kind":"html","html":"<div class=\"tableWrapper_flOe\"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Description</th><th>Bubbles</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>ionChange</code></td><td>Emitted when the value property has changed as a result of a user action such as a click.<br><br>This event will not emit when programmatically setting the <code>value</code> property.</td><td><code>true</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"methods","text":"Methods"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No public methods available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"css-shadow-parts","text":"CSS Shadow Parts"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No CSS shadow parts available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"css-custom-properties","text":"CSS Custom Properties"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No CSS custom properties available for this component.</p>"},{"kind":"heading","level":2,"id":"slots","text":"Slots"},{"kind":"html","html":"<p>No slots available for this component.</p>"}]